msgid ""
"Depends on your definition.  I'm alive, aren't I?  When Hell itself came down from the skies and monsters started "
"attacking the cities, I grabbed my stuff and got to my hideout.  But I still saw some stuff from where I was.  I "
"watched those things stride past.  I still have nightmares about the way their bodies moved, like they broke the "
"world just to be here.  I had nothing better to do.  I watched them rip up those goons with weapons, watched the "
"dead rise back up and start fighting the living.  I watched a nice old lady rip the head off a dog.  I saw a body "
"twitch and grow into some kind of electrified hulk beast.  I watched it all happen."
msgstr ""
"Зависит от точки зрения. Я же жива, верно? Когда сам Ад снизошёл с небес, а монстры напали на города, я схватила "
