"I ran until I felt like my lungs were going to jump right out of my mouth.  I holed up in the forest for the "
"night, under a fir tree.  In the morning I heard someone talking, so I went to see.  I was playing it pretty "
"careful though, there were still a lot of psychos and rioters around.  I snuck up on some kind of thing, some "
