msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what the hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded "
"out and ready to go offroading, I had a ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let me "
"bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I sure as shit didn't run."
