"мудаков. Рано или поздно один из них меня прикончит, но я умру с осознанием, что сделал что-то действительно "
"важное."

msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a life, everyone died.  Boo hoo.  I gotta be straight with you though: I "
"honestly think I like this better.  Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've killed "
"hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me out, but I'll go down knowing I did "
"something actually important."
msgstr ""
