"Well, the references weren't quite right.  Pat referred to things that we'd never played.  The situations were "
"close, but not right, and when I put it all together, it told a story.  A story about a scholar whose kids were "
"being held captive, forced to research dark magic for them.  And there was a clincher: A warning that the magic "
