"Meter-based sidebar for wide displays.\n"
"\n"
"Includes support for the following mods: <color_light_green>Magiclysm</color>, <color_light_green>Mind over "
"Matter</color>, <color_light_green>Sky Island</color>, and <color_light_green>Xedra Evolved</color>.\n"
"\n"
