"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will begin every expedition with the ability to withstand 10 pulses instead of the default 8, allowing "
"you to stay out 25% longer before warpsickness takes over."
msgstr ""
"Каким-то образом вы понимаете, что статуя взывает к чему-то, что может усилить ее силу.\n"
